Third-party software that ships inside Eaon
-------------------------------------------

Eaon CLI is a fork of OpenCode (https://github.com/sst/opencode), Eaon
runs local models with llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), and
computer use runs on Cua Driver (https://github.com/trycua/cua). All three
are MIT-licensed, and their copyright and permission notices follow.

Browser control uses Browser Use (https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use,
MIT) and uv (https://github.com/astral-sh/uv, Apache-2.0 or MIT). Neither
ships inside Eaon: Settings → Browser control downloads them from their own
releases.

